Package: atch
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Attach and detach terminal sessions
 atch is a small C utility that lets you attach and detach terminal sessions,
 similar to the detach feature of screen/tmux but without terminal emulation,
 multiple windows, or other overhead. The raw byte stream flows directly from
 the pty to your terminal, so mouse, scroll, colours, and graphics all work
 unmodified.
